WEBVTT

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.250
Hello!

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.950
I am Celes the hunter!

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:24.750
I'm here in search of a man named Genzo!

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.790
You're Genzo!

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:28.500
The demon beast killer!

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.700
Chop to the head!

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:36.580
My head!

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:39.160
Hey...

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.580
Oww! Oww!

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:43.370
I'm sorry! Stop it!

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:22.950
"First Student x Pain in the Butt"

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:25.700
The fight lasted five seconds.

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:29.580
The deciding move was the figure-four leg lock.

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:33.660
You okay?

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:36.870
Those weird techniques Genzo uses hurt.

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:40.790
The more you struggle the worse it gets.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:45.950
Thank... you...

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:52.040
So, why are you here?

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:54.290
If you want to do an interview
talk to the maid first.

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:56.200
Who are you calling a maid?

00:02:56.200 --> 00:03:00.500
I'm not your servant, you pervert human.

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:01.830
Get 'em! Go! Go!

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:04.910
Um, so did you need something?

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:07.700
I'll start over. My name is Celes.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.870
A hunter who's just come here
to the town of Cluster.

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:12.080
The guild master said that

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:16.330
Genzo is an incredibly powerful hunter
nicknamed the demon beast killer!

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:19.120
So it's time for round two?

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:20.040
Sorry!

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:22.120
I don't know what I said
that pissed you off but I'm sorry!

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:24.250
That old bearded bastard.

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:27.830
Next time I meet him, I think it's time
for a figure-four beard lock!

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:32.660
So basically, you planned to challenge
Genzo because he's famous

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:35.750
and raise your own profile?

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:37.250
No!

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:43.910
Genzo, please... Please make me your student.

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:45.500
Student?

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:49.620
I have a reason I have to become strong.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.910
Please... please!

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:53.080
I refuse.

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:56.450
I'm busy!

00:03:56.450 --> 00:04:02.410
I'm off to go lie down in front of stray catsso
they'll step on me with their paws!

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:06.160
Genzo, the neighbors are complaining.

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:08.950
They're telling you not to lay down
in the middle of the road.

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:11.000
Please!

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.830
I can't do much, but I will repay you!

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:21.290
If you want, I can even pay with my body...

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:24.500
I refuse.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:29.700
Come back when you're
as attractive as a kobold.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.370
I'm less attractive than a kobold?

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:35.120
Please! Please!

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.660
You're in the way!

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:40.160
If you don't leave me alone
I'll give you a cobra twist...

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:42.660
You're...

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:44.450
Sorry to both you.

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:47.750
Never mind what I said
about being your student.

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:48.750
Wait.

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.910
Wh-What are you doing?

00:04:57.290 --> 00:05:01.200
So you're a lizardman, huh?

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:05.370
That's right.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:09.160
No... my ancestors were lizardmen.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:15.500
We look like demon beasts,
so people are afraid of us.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.660
In my case, my genes showed up here,

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:22.000
and I have a scaly stomach and back...

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:25.790
Celes, a lady mustn't show
any more of her stomach!

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:28.200
You're in the presence of a man! Behave!

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:32.580
Genzo will go after anyone, and his eyes
are already getting dangerous...

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:34.330
Hang on, guys.

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:36.410
I'm not like that.

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:37.620
All right then, Genzo.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:39.330
Will you make her your student?

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:41.200
Of course I will.

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:43.660
Are you stupid?

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:46.040
Really?

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:48.910
You should rethink this, Celes.

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:53.200
If you want, I'll teach you
my special move, "Death Roll"...

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:58.120
No, he accepted me
even though I'm a lizardman.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:00.790
I want Genzo to teach me!

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:02.580
Somebody worry about me.

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:06.500
Okay! We're off to
the mountains to train, then!

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:08.540
Oh, fine.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:10.450
We'll help...

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:12.290
...as much as we can!

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:16.580
Strength starts with the posterior chain!

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:19.370
Hands above your head and squat!

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:21.330
Yes, sir!

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:24.370
One...

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:26.700
Two...

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:28.370
Three...

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:32.250
Four...

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:33.830
Tell me, my student.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:37.410
Do your lizardman genes only show
on your stomach and back?

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:40.750
Do your thighs and biceps
ever get covered in scales?

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:44.910
Only my back and stomach, yes.

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:46.120
Oh, I see.

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:48.660
Forget the squats, then.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:53.000
We're moving on to core and back work!

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:54.290
Get to work!

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:57.950
Um, I've only done four squats.

00:06:57.950 --> 00:06:59.500
Genzo...

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:03.000
It's obvious what you're thinking.

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:10.870
If you want to train your legs and core,
I can teach you better than him.

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:12.950
Follow me!

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:15.000
Okay, Shigure!

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.450
Thanks--

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:22.540
She's fast.

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:25.950
To get big, you need to eat big!

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:28.160
Don't be a picky eater!

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:32.750
Hanako! Lizardmen... aren't like lizards!

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:34.870
We don't eat bugs!

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:37.870
But I went through all
the trouble of catching it.

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:39.870
I'll eat it then.

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:46.330
You don't have to copy that.

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:48.290
A strong woman is beautiful!

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:52.200
Copy my sexy pose!

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:56.950
Sexy pose...

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:58.500
Not at all alike.

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:34.500
There's nothing else I can teach you.

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:36.870
Well done.

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:43.040
Thank you for everything, sir!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:46.370
No female wrestler is a match for you now!

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:48.750
Wear this name with pride!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.080
Your ring name is...

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:51.750
...Celes XXL!

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:55.200
Yes! My name is Celes XXL!

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:58.330
Your first student...

00:08:58.330 --> 00:09:00.450
No!

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:01.660
What?

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:03.910
You don't like the name Celes XXL?

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:06.000
Hey, Carmilla, what do you think?

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:09.120
I think it accurately describes
her physical attributes.

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:12.330
Maybe XXL is too small?

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:15.080
It's not the name!

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:18.000
This isn't what I want to be!

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:22.450
You're saying you prefer
to fight without a mask?

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:23.580
No!

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:27.500
I'm not trying to become one
of those weird "wrestler" things!

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.870
Um...

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:32.000
I should've started by asking this,

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:35.660
but why did you want to learn from Genzo?

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:39.290
It is really late to ask that question.

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:43.000
It's a really boring story.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:46.000
I'm sure it's more fun than
listening to Carmilla brag.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:49.330
Genzo, let me hit you later.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:51.540
Actually...

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:57.500
What?!

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:03.910
I will bathe in your blood!

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:22.410
Old Man!

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:24.290
Hey, Guild Master!

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:26.450
Get your ass out here!

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:31.790
Or I'll start executing every
hunter here, one by one!

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:34.000
What's wrong?

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.290
Execution!

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:42.040
Sir, wait!

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:44.200
Calm down!

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:45.540
Let me go!

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:48.370
Hey, is that the halfbreed?

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:53.450
You're right! The halfbreed animalis
still hanging around, huh?

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:55.870
Want me to hunt her?

00:10:57.290 --> 00:10:59.250
Execution!

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:02.950
Hey, grab him!

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:05.000
He'll destroy the guild!

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:09.330
Sir...

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:13.450
Execution! Execution!

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:15.660
Stop it!

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:17.870
Execution!

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:22.290
Get 'em, Genzo!

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:23.660
You're being too loud!

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:26.040
What's going on?

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:27.580
Hi.

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:36.250
Really, what's going on here?

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:41.950
Let's hear your explanation,
demon beast killer!

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:48.200
Call me that one more time
and I rip your beard off.

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:55.620
Now, now, Genzo. Calm down.

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:59.580
Really, what's wrong with you?

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:01.620
What's wrong with me?

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:03.580
Oww! Oww!

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:05.080
Listen up, geezer!

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:07.330
You know that I'm a kind man whose heart

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:11.040
is filled with love for all creatures, right?

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:13.080
Yes, I know.

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:16.040
I didn't understand a word you said,

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:18.120
but I got the fact that you're a weirdo!

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:21.080
Your piece-of-shit hunters
are bullying a lizardman

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:21.080
but I got the fact that you're a weirdo!

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:25.330
and doing all kinds of naughty things to them!

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:28.160
Sir, calm down!

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:30.410
They haven't been doing
anything naughty to me.

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:34.450
Just teasing me...
and kind of messing with me...

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:41.250
Messing with you? Messing with you?

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:42.410
Was it your stomach?

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:46.250
Did they mess with your shiny stomach?

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:48.950
No, I mean...

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:50.870
They didn't?

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:54.790
So you're saying that my guild's hunters

00:12:54.790 --> 00:13:00.750
have been harassing and
upsetting Celes the lizardman?

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:04.540
And so Celes came to you to train, and...

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:08.790
I wanted to teach the other hunters a lesson.

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:15.250
But I realized that I was upset over
something that didn't matter at all.

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:18.000
Now that my teachers have
told me I've mastered the art,

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:20.660
and I've attained real strength,

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:24.160
I don't care about it anymore.

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:26.660
So it's okay.

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:31.790
Now I want to focus on being
a wonderful person like my teacher!

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:33.330
Celes!

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:36.910
We're sorry!

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:41.540
I'm sorry, for calling you a halfbreed...

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:46.950
Our hunts haven't been going
well lately, and we've been upset.

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:50.950
And since you're a demihuman and
the new girl, we took it out on you.

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:52.580
Sorry.

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:58.500
I'm not having it.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:10.370
Listen, Celes.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:13.500
Life is a battle. Survival of the fittest.

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:15.830
No human can let anyone underestimate them.

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:18.620
Sir, I'm a lizardman.

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:23.700
You're my student. And a wrestler.

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:26.830
A wrestler must accept any challenge!

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:29.790
Sir, I'm a hunter.

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:34.160
Listen up, Celes!

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:36.120
Don't spoil them just because they showed

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:37.910
the slightest sign of apologizing to you.

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.500
A lizardman was being abused!

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:44.790
I'm not letting it all end on a happy note!

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:47.450
As your teacher, I order you to fight them!

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:50.870
Beat them flat until they
understand how strong you are!

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:54.410
What a pain...

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:58.330
Sir, I appreciate it, but...

00:14:58.330 --> 00:14:59.950
I'm really fine...

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:05.000
If you won't do it, then I'll execute them all.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:09.700
Genzo... cares about me that much?

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:12.040
That's probably wrong.

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:14.080
You should apologize!

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.160
He's serious.

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:17.500
Say sorry.

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:22.540
Bow to the both of them
and say you're sorry again.

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:24.910
All right, sir.

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:29.580
If it's a battle until one side gives up,
instead of a duel to the death...

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:36.870
I'm a little curious to see how strong
I've gotten after your training.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:38.370
Sounds fun...

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:41.040
If you insist, I'll fight you.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:44.750
But I won't hold back
just because you're new!

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:56.790
Celes, your legs!

00:15:56.790 --> 00:15:58.830
Use your legs more!

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:02.000
What?

00:16:06.200 --> 00:16:07.750
Damn it!

00:16:09.040 --> 00:16:11.620
Celes! Bite 'em!

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:17.790
Bite his soft, delicious side,
and eat his intestines!

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:21.500
I won't let you!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:27.830
Hey, if you're going to fight, don't lose!

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:30.040
Show her who's boss!

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:33.910
Don't let your guard down! She's good!

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:35.950
Turn it around! Get her!

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:42.500
Celes, you can do it!

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:46.620
The thigh! Aim for the chewy thigh first!

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:49.370
If you lose, no dinner for you tonight!

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:59.200
It's rather lively today.

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:02.040
Oh, Clause.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.160
What is this?

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:05.910
A mock battle.

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:08.410
It's a long story.

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:20.830
Okay, now finish him!

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:24.080
Sexy pose!

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:31.870
Owww!

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:36.080
What the hell were you thinking?

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:36.080
Genzo, harder! Harder!

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:40.790
Hey, forget Carmilla and focus on the fight!

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:44.000
Celes is in trouble!

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:46.450
What was that?

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:49.870
Were you training to learn something so dumb?

00:17:49.870 --> 00:17:53.540
I was about to change my opinion on
lizardmen and now I just feel stupid!

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:55.160
No...

00:17:57.370 --> 00:17:59.540
It's over!

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:02.660
Celes! His arms went up!

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:11.120
What?

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:18.160
Hooray!

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:19.700
You did it!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:21.790
His weapon's mine now!

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:23.700
That was amazing!

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.750
What was that?

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:30.080
I admit defeat.

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:31.620
You're really amazing.

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:33.870
I underestimated lizardmen.

00:18:33.870 --> 00:18:37.790
No, it was a wonderful match.

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:41.040
And that wasn't a perfect victory.

00:18:41.040 --> 00:18:44.660
I lost both of my weapons.

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:47.910
So it's a tie, then?

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:50.790
Yes. Let's try it again sometime.

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:53.200
Next time, I won't lose.

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:58.500
Not having it!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:03.580
Genzo, what's gotten into you today?

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:06.120
Why are you being such a pain?

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:09.790
Everybody had their happy ending,
so let's go home.

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:12.790
I refuse to accept that someone can abuse

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:16.200
a demihuman and then
get off with just an apology!

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:19.620
Genzo, you're really being a pain!

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:21.040
Let me go, Shigure!

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:25.870
I need to make an example out of them
to prevent there from being a next victim!

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:30.620
When we get back you can rub my ears.

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:34.080
Um, Genzo.

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:35.700
Calm down.

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:40.040
They've been having trouble
with their hunts lately.

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:41.410
I don't give a damn--

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:43.870
They did say that...

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:47.540
Lately, a beastman with
a bare chest like a barbarian

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:49.500
has been appearing out of nowhere...

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:51.080
What? A beastman?

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:54.120
Yes, I think it's a weretiger or something.

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:55.950
Whenever we catch a demon beast,

00:19:55.950 --> 00:19:59.330
it appears out of nowhere
and runs off with our prey.

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:02.750
I think it had some kind of weird cape.

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:06.910
It appears out of nowhere and
attacks us with strange techniques...

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:10.330
Even if we catch our prey, they still...

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:15.370
I know it's not your fault. We're sorry.

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:17.500
I guess that's an okay explanation.

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:19.830
Celes, forgive them.

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:22.950
Okay, I'm fine with that...

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:26.700
We're really sorry!

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:33.620
Genzo, may I have a word?

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:34.540
No.

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:37.450
Was the person they were talking about...

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:41.000
Shigure, it's a waste of time to even ask.

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:42.660
No idea.

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:47.660
I wondered where all those new
demon beasts were coming from!

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:53.790
May I have a word?

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:57.540
A public tournament?

00:20:57.540 --> 00:21:01.500
Yes. I was very impressed by that mock battle.

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:06.580
I think people would get very excited
to see combat as a form of entertainment.

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:08.790
In addition to selling tickets
to the event itself,

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:11.540
we could sell merchandise and food.

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:14.410
It should turn a considerable profit.

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:16.040
Sounds great!

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:18.620
I'll do anything to help fix our budget!

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:22.790
If you're selling merchandise,
you should sell some stuff for the Mistress.

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:24.540
It'll sell out in an instant!

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:27.080
There'll be food, right?

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:29.080
I think it's a great idea.

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:31.160
But I want to run a pet shop...

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:37.120
If you appear in the fights, we'll pay you.

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:40.000
Won't it help you get the money
you need to open your business?

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:44.000
Fight money, huh?

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:47.790
What is this feeling of excitement?

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:51.000
My muscles are screaming at me to fight!

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:58.450
If the training my body has endured
can now help the animals...

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:00.450
Very well!

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:03.500
A wrestler accepts any challenge!

00:22:10.160 --> 00:22:13.660
So I'm a pro wrestler in this world now, too?

00:23:46.160 --> 00:23:49.660
Next time: "Animal x Event."
